msgid ""
"The B<bcopy>()  function copies I<n> bytes from I<src> to I<dest>.  The "
"result is correct, even when both areas overlap."
msgstr ""
"La función B<bcopy>() copia I<n> bytes de I<src> a I<dest>. El resultado es "
"correcto, aun cuando ambas areas se solapan."

