msgstr "4.3BSD."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "4.3BSD.  This function is deprecated -- use B<memcpy> in new programs.  "
#| "Note that the first two parameters are interchanged for B<memcpy>."
msgid ""
"Marked as LEGACY in POSIX.1-2001: use B<memcpy>(3)  or B<memmove>(3)  in new "
"programs.  Note that the first two arguments are interchanged for "
"B<memcpy>(3)  and B<memmove>(3).  POSIX.1-2008 removes the specification of "
"B<bcopy>()."
msgstr ""
"4.3BSD.  Esta función está obsoleta -- use B<memcpy> en programas nuevos. "
"Observe que los primeros dos parámetros están intercambiados para B<memcpy>."

